        <mxCell id="transaction-dialog-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" value="Record transaction opens a dialog at every width: Deposit/Withdrawal selector, positive amount (up to two decimals), optional comment (up to 500 characters), mode-coloured submit. Errors retain input; success closes and refreshes balance/history. No inline transaction form.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Right-aligned actions: icon-only refresh, then labelled Record transaction for Managers with an opening balance. On phones the action group wraps together onto a right-aligned line. Rename stays beside the name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Managers only. The mode is shown by color plus sign: deposit green (+), withdrawal red (−) on the selected toggle, the amount sign, and the button. Submitting disables the button until the backend confirms; retries reuse the same request so nothing is booked twice. Withdrawals may make the balance negative.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Member: balance, allowance and history only; no business-write controls. Phone: labelled Record transaction stays after refresh in the header and opens a full-screen dialog. Balance, allowance and history remain stacked; amounts are never truncated." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="480" x="2140" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
