        <mxCell id="undefined-60" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" value="Managers: avatar edits the image (PNG/JPEG/WebP); pencil beside the heading renames (1-40 characters, unique). Errors keep input; Cancel keeps the name. Members see no edit controls. Rename is available only on this page." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="480" x="680" y="-120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="undefined-63" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" value="Newest first, 20 per page. Dates in the business timezone, formatted for the language. Amounts signed and colored. Without transactions: &quot;No transactions yet&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="480" x="2140" y="740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="undefined-64" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;Not initialized&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The balance shows &quot;Not initialized&quot;. Managers get an &quot;Opening amount&quot; form instead of &quot;Record transaction&quot;: signed amount (may be zero or negative), optional comment, &quot;Post opening amount&quot;. Final once posted, so a confirmation dialog asks before posting. Members see a note instead." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="136" width="480" x="20" y="192" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="undefined-65" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Calibri;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;Monthly allowance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amount per month or &quot;No monthly allowance&quot;; status &quot;Credited this month on …&quot; or &quot;Next credit on …&quot;; Managers also see failed credits with the reason. Managers: &quot;Set allowance&quot; opens a dialog (amount ≥ 0, on/off). Credits appear in the history as &quot;Allowance&quot; by &quot;Automatic&quot;. Saving never books money itself." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="144" width="480" x="20" y="596" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
